<title>USA: Pen Interconnect 1996 fiscal runs loss.</title>
<headline>Pen Interconnect 1996 fiscal runs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.26	   profit $0.36</p>
<p> Net loss	  709	     profit 617</p>
<p> Net sales	 25,000		   15,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,700		    1,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Pen Interconnect Inc.</p>
<p>Fiscal year ended September 30.</p>
<p>The company said the rise in net sales was due to its acquisition of Incirt Technology and a full year of sales from its San Jose division.</p>
<p>It said the net loss was due to inventory shrinkage, labor inefficiency, higher labor rates, training costs, scrapped material, acquisition and reorganization costs.</p>
</text>
